            0.883,
            0.142
          ],
          "content": "Look at Fig. 12.5, and try to identify interactions among biotic components, and between biotic and abiotic components based on your learnings till now."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.268,
            0.154,
            0.782,
            0.179
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Activity 12.4: Let us relate and identify"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.273,
            0.192,
            0.883,
            0.231
          ],
          "content": "z Based on the given criteria, **identify** and **describe** the interactions between biotic and abiotic components shown in Fig. 12.5."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.296,
            0.234,
            0.411,
            0.252
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Criterion 1"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.294,
            0.254,
            0.883,
            0.31
          ],
          "content": "Interactions between abiotic and biotic components. These may influence life processes like nutrition, respiration, and reproduction in biotic components."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.296,
            0.311,
            0.416,
            0.328
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Criterion 2"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.295,
            0.331,
            0.882,
            0.368
          ],
          "content": "Interaction between two abiotic components these may influence the physical characteristics of a habitat."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.296,
            0.37,
            0.41,
            0.387
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Criterion 3"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.294,
            0.39,
            0.883,
            0.445
          ],
          "content": "Interaction among the biotic components. These may influence the availability of resources needed for life processes like nutrition, respiration, and reproduction."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.273,
            0.446,
            0.741,
            0.466
          ],
          "content": "**Relate** your learning with your observations."
